  "id":"s1-u2-03","title":"Exprimer ses goûts","titleAr":"التعبير عن الميول والأذواق","source":"Club @dos Plus 1 pp.29-32; Cahier pp.88-89 | Enrichment: Merci 2027 + Bravo 2027","status":"enriched-qa","objectiveAr":"التعبير عن ما نحب ونعشق ونكره وما لا نحب، السؤال عن ميول الآخرين، وبناء إجابات كاملة باستخدام أفعال -er والنفي ne...pas.","communication":["Dire ce qu'on aime","Dire ce qu'on adore","Dire ce qu'on déteste","Dire ce qu'on n'aime pas","Demander les goûts","Comparer les goûts","Justifier simplement un goût"],"vocabulary":[{"word":"aimer","translation":"يحب"},{"word":"adorer","translation":"يعشق / يحب جدًا"},{"word":"détester","translation":"يكره"},{"word":"préférer","translation":"يفضل"},{"word":"la musique","translation":"الموسيقى"},{"word":"l'art","translation":"الفن"},{"word":"la géographie","translation":"الجغرافيا"},{"word":"la lecture","translation":"القراءة"},{"word":"le sport","translation":"الرياضة"},{"word":"le tennis","translation":"التنس"},{"word":"le football","translation":"كرة القدم"},{"word":"le cinéma","translation":"السينما"},{"word":"les maths","translation":"الرياضيات"},{"word":"le français","translation":"اللغة الفرنسية"},{"word":"l'histoire","translation":"التاريخ"},{"word":"les sciences","translation":"العلوم"},{"word":"la danse","translation":"الرقص"},{"word":"les jeux vidéo","translation":"ألعاب الفيديو"},{"word":"la télévision","translation":"التلفاز"},{"word":"un film","translation":"فيلم"}],"grammar":{"title":"Verbes en -er + négation ne...pas","explanationAr":"الأفعال المنتظمة المنتهية بـ -er تتبع نمطًا ثابتًا في المضارع. للنفي نضع ne قبل الفعل وpas بعده، وتتحول ne إلى n' قبل حرف متحرك.","conjugationExample":{"aimer":["j'aime","tu aimes","il/elle/on aime","nous aimons","vous aimez","ils/elles aiment"]},"additionalConjugation":{"adorer":["j'adore","tu adores","il/elle adore","nous adorons","vous adorez","ils/elles adorent"],"détester":["je déteste","tu détestes","il/elle déteste","nous détestons","vous détestez","ils/elles détest